# Ripgrep / Codex file-search prune list.
# This repo sits on BeeGFS: unscoped glob/grep is dominated by metadata, not CPU.
# Patterns here are local junk already covered by .gitignore; they must not be walked.

docs/fumadocs/node_modules/
docs/fumadocs/.next/
docs/fumadocs/tmp/
tmp/
.git/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.egg-info/
worldfoundry.egg-info/
